{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A survival strategy game where humanity\u2019s last fleet drifts through the ruins of civilization, chasing a myth among the stars.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A failed jump. A collapsed gate. Silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in deep space. Adrift, alone, and far from any known system. Civilization is gone. The fleet you command may be all that\u2019s left of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oxygen is low. Systems are failing.</strong> There are no reinforcements, no reinvention, only what you carry and what you can salvage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear: <strong>adapt, endure, and find the mythical system known only as ETERNITY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/38e214ef54b1998529b6e4cd7e1997cd.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/38e214ef54b1998529b6e4cd7e1997cd.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/38e214ef54b1998529b6e4cd7e1997cd.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a procedurally generated star map where each run is different. Discover lifeless worlds, derelict stations, strange anomalies, and long-dead outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan, survey, and decide: risk deeper exploration, or play it safe to survive another cycle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/16c8a5f109d5d487c972299f02a618a0.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/16c8a5f109d5d487c972299f02a618a0.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/16c8a5f109d5d487c972299f02a618a0.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every resource matters. Balance oxygen, water, food, and power across multiple ships\u2014each a vital, irreplaceable asset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When one ship fails, others suffer. When one system collapses, your entire fleet trembles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single oversight can cascade into disaster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0d87327a2edfa95d6e17eaa1fdd44cd2.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0d87327a2edfa95d6e17eaa1fdd44cd2.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0d87327a2edfa95d6e17eaa1fdd44cd2.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No new ships will ever arrive. Adapt what you have. Salvage what you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign roles, transfer cargo, rewire hulls: mining rigs, sensor platforms, defense corvettes, mobile farms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ship becomes what the fleet needs...until it breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/60eb05b3ddce07bde96e9540e4e497f7.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/60eb05b3ddce07bde96e9540e4e497f7.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/60eb05b3ddce07bde96e9540e4e497f7.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survivors are more than stats, they are fragile, desperate humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solar flares, system failures, unrest, and moral dilemmas test your leadership.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass laws. Enforce discipline, or risk collapse from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ce6b7f0c0cd3bd3f1387bf8c5f198da7.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ce6b7f0c0cd3bd3f1387bf8c5f198da7.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ce6b7f0c0cd3bd3f1387bf8c5f198da7.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all remnants of mankind are friendly. Pirates, rogue AIs, and broken factions lurk in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in desperate ship-to-ship combat, repel boarding actions, and sacrifice what you must to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/93339959ecac7d96027c2d79d4b58dd9.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/93339959ecac7d96027c2d79d4b58dd9.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/93339959ecac7d96027c2d79d4b58dd9.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What shattered the galactic network? Why is the galaxy silent?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover fragments of data, haunted transmissions, and buried logs to piece together what happened after the jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end lies <i>ETERNITY</i>, and with it, the truth\u2026 or oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/db40f8d4ef241e4d5213e5a9b304e22d.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/db40f8d4ef241e4d5213e5a9b304e22d.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/db40f8d4ef241e4d5213e5a9b304e22d.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic, systemic survival</strong>: Every resource is linked. Every system can break.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Irreplaceable fleet</strong>: Ships are rare. Customize what you have, strive to salvage abandoned hulls, or watch it burn. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated galaxy</strong>: Fresh runs, fresh challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive events and choices</strong>: Crew unrest, flare storms, sabotage, and moral decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative mystery</strong>: Discover what ended humanity, and what lies beyond. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical combat</strong>: Limited tools. High stakes. No second chances.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability through emergent storytelling</strong>: Every playthrough tells a different tale of failure, resilience, or triumph.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/391670?t=1761349739","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/367f69d73031c2a5e56903467dab02ceb58b92a8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761349739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/1955973d78be8c02d5c2bebda5de8f7637a43463/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761349739","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/1955973d78be8c02d5c2bebda5de8f7637a43463/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761349739","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"VR Support","id":31},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A survival strategy game where humanity\u2019s last fleet drifts through the ruins of civilization, chasing a myth among the stars.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A failed jump. A collapsed gate. Silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in deep space. Adrift, alone, and far from any known system. Civilization is gone. The fleet you command may be all that\u2019s left of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oxygen is low. Systems are failing.</strong> There are no reinforcements, no reinvention, only what you carry and what you can salvage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear: <strong>adapt, endure, and find the mythical system known only as ETERNITY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/38e214ef54b1998529b6e4cd7e1997cd.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/38e214ef54b1998529b6e4cd7e1997cd.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/38e214ef54b1998529b6e4cd7e1997cd.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a procedurally generated star map where each run is different. Discover lifeless worlds, derelict stations, strange anomalies, and long-dead outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan, survey, and decide: risk deeper exploration, or play it safe to survive another cycle?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/16c8a5f109d5d487c972299f02a618a0.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/16c8a5f109d5d487c972299f02a618a0.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/16c8a5f109d5d487c972299f02a618a0.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every resource matters. Balance oxygen, water, food, and power across multiple ships\u2014each a vital, irreplaceable asset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When one ship fails, others suffer. When one system collapses, your entire fleet trembles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single oversight can cascade into disaster.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0d87327a2edfa95d6e17eaa1fdd44cd2.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0d87327a2edfa95d6e17eaa1fdd44cd2.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0d87327a2edfa95d6e17eaa1fdd44cd2.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No new ships will ever arrive. Adapt what you have. Salvage what you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign roles, transfer cargo, rewire hulls: mining rigs, sensor platforms, defense corvettes, mobile farms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ship becomes what the fleet needs...until it breaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/60eb05b3ddce07bde96e9540e4e497f7.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/60eb05b3ddce07bde96e9540e4e497f7.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/60eb05b3ddce07bde96e9540e4e497f7.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survivors are more than stats, they are fragile, desperate humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solar flares, system failures, unrest, and moral dilemmas test your leadership.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass laws. Enforce discipline, or risk collapse from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ce6b7f0c0cd3bd3f1387bf8c5f198da7.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ce6b7f0c0cd3bd3f1387bf8c5f198da7.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ce6b7f0c0cd3bd3f1387bf8c5f198da7.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all remnants of mankind are friendly. Pirates, rogue AIs, and broken factions lurk in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in desperate ship-to-ship combat, repel boarding actions, and sacrifice what you must to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/93339959ecac7d96027c2d79d4b58dd9.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/93339959ecac7d96027c2d79d4b58dd9.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/93339959ecac7d96027c2d79d4b58dd9.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What shattered the galactic network? Why is the galaxy silent?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover fragments of data, haunted transmissions, and buried logs to piece together what happened after the jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end lies <i>ETERNITY</i>, and with it, the truth\u2026 or oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/db40f8d4ef241e4d5213e5a9b304e22d.poster.avif?t=1761349739\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/db40f8d4ef241e4d5213e5a9b304e22d.webm?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/db40f8d4ef241e4d5213e5a9b304e22d.mp4?t=1761349739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic, systemic survival</strong>: Every resource is linked. Every system can break.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Irreplaceable fleet</strong>: Ships are rare. Customize what you have, strive to salvage abandoned hulls, or watch it burn. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated galaxy</strong>: Fresh runs, fresh challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive events and choices</strong>: Crew unrest, flare storms, sabotage, and moral decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative mystery</strong>: Discover what ended humanity, and what lies beyond. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical combat</strong>: Limited tools. High stakes. No second chances.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability through emergent storytelling</strong>: Every playthrough tells a different tale of failure, resilience, or triumph.</p>","developers":["Firedrake Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/header.jpg?t=1761349739","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Firedrake Games. All rights reserved. ","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/391670/627925965/365b8ae453e59bdf4f9f1899c09de880337024ae/1750952267/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754582539","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/391670/627925965/365b8ae453e59bdf4f9f1899c09de880337024ae/1750952267/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754582539","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/391670/627925965/365b8ae453e59bdf4f9f1899c09de880337024ae/1750952267/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754582539","id":257161945,"name":"Eternity Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257161945/e4e4530b8a5ec2654819e65a3ab8f0a60b02a92d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754582539"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/391670/1128359325/3115c3493aebd36e022ba70d20a77d050b167446/1751274834/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754582541","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/391670/1128359325/3115c3493aebd36e022ba70d20a77d050b167446/1751274834/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754582541","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/391670/1128359325/3115c3493aebd36e022ba70d20a77d050b167446/1751274834/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754582541","id":257155487,"name":"Eternity Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155487/9a9e516795a08f59a563fadb32d65c71136cb761/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754582541"}],"name":"Eternity","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Ground Control Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_